<v Maya>want to optimize, say, a crystal structure.</v>

29
00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:30.605
<v Daniel>Or a protein confirmation. Yeah, you're starting from scratch every single time you change fields. It's mathematically rigorous, but incredibly rigid.</v>

30
00:03:30.745 --> 00:03:34.628
<v Maya>OK, so that's compass number one. On the flip side, we have large language models.</v>

