<v Daniel>Exactly. But, and this is a big but, they have zero calibrated uncertainty. They don't know what they don't know.</v>

34
00:03:49.559 --> 00:03:58.266
<v Maya>And if you're a lab director managing a million dollar budget, you know, an AI hallucination from ChatGPT isn't just some funny quirk you screenshot for social media.</v>

35
00:03:58.346 --> 00:03:59.867
<v Daniel>No, it's a massive waste of resources.</v>

36
00:04:00.175 --> 00:04:04.879
