00:05:47.106 --> 00:05:53.530
<v Daniel>mathematical score of how well the model explains the data while penalizing it for being too complex or overconfident.</v>

52
00:05:53.723 --> 00:05:59.407
<v Maya>So it forces the language model to only speak up when it's mathematically justified by those uncertainty objectives.</v>

53
00:05:59.588 --> 00:06:09.055
<v Daniel>Exactly. Gollum is basically that 2015 deep kernel learning concept, but the neural feature extractor just happens to be a massive language model, and the input happens to be English text.</v>

