<v Daniel>that actuary is ruleable.</v>

73
00:08:36.597 --> 00:08:37.199
<v Maya>Right, right.</v>

74
00:08:37.721 --> 00:08:52.029
<v Daniel>Nobody explicitly coded the AI to organize chemistry this way. But the math naturally acts as a secret contrastive loss function. It physically pulls experiments with similar outcomes closer together in the model's brain,</v>

