<v Daniel>and it violently pushes failed experiments far apart.</v>

76
00:08:55.791 --> 00:09:05.696
<v Maya>OK, so by the time you reach like iteration 50 of this optimization loop, the model's internal latent space has completely reorganized itself into a chemically meaningful map.</v>

77
00:09:05.916 --> 00:09:16.686
